OpenAI BPE encoding assets
==========================

The files in this directory are the unmodified encoding data published by
OpenAI for tiktoken 0.12.0. They are bundled so request accounting performs no
network access on first use.

Source URLs:
- https://openaipublic.blob.core.windows.net/encodings/cl100k_base.tiktoken
- https://openaipublic.blob.core.windows.net/encodings/o200k_base.tiktoken

